                    YON RUNTIME LINKING EXCEPTION

  As a special exception, the copyright holders of the Yon runtime
  library give you permission to link or combine object code produced
  by the Yon compiler from your own source programs with this runtime
  library (statically or dynamically) to produce an executable, and to
